{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-concurrency","title":"自适应并发控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/adaptive-concurrency","wordCount":1699,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"自适应并发控制\">自适应并发控制</h1><p>静态限额（&quot;每分钟不超过 1000 次请求&quot;）在系统负载稳定时工作良好，但真实的生产环境远非稳定——后端服务的处理能力随部署规模、GC 压力、下游依赖状态实时变化。一个在正常时可以轻松处理 1000 QPS 的服务，在数据库慢查询期间可能 200 QPS 就开始超时。自适应并发控制（Adaptive Concurrency）用实时延迟信号替代静态配置，让限流策略跟随系统的真实能力动态调整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自适应并发控制的核心思想借鉴自 TCP 拥塞控制：不预设固定的速率上限，而是通过观察系统的实时反馈信号（主要是延迟），动态调整允许同时处理的请求数量。当延迟正常时逐步增加并发（探索更高的吞吐），当延迟上升时快速收缩并发（保护系统不崩溃）。这使得限流策略能够自动适应后端容量的实时变化——无论是扩容、缩容、还是部分故障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从速率限制到并发限制的范式转换\">从速率限制到并发限制的范式转换</h2><p>传统速率限制回答的问题是：&quot;单位时间内允许多少个请求？&quot;——这是一个<strong>吞吐量</strong>维度的约束。而自适应并发控制回答的是：&quot;此刻允许多少个请求同时在处理中？&quot;——这是一个<strong>并发度</strong>维度的约束。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>速率限制</th>\n<th>并发限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制变量</td>\n<td>请求数/时间</td>\n<td>同时在途请求数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适应性</td>\n<td>静态（人工配置）</td>\n<td>动态（信号驱动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对慢请求的反应</td>\n<td>无直接关联</td>\n<td>慢请求占用并发槽位更久</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Little&#39;s Law 视角</td>\n<td>控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> (到达率)</td>\n<td>控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> (系统中的请求数)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Little&#39;s Law</strong> 揭示了并发限制的数学基础：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> = 系统中平均请求数（并发度），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> = 到达速率（吞吐量），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> = 平均响应时间。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 上升（后端变慢）时，如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 会自然增长——并发请求堆积，最终耗尽线程池/连接池。自适应并发控制通过主动降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（减少允许的在途请求数），间接降低了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，从而防止堆积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"netflix-concurrency-limits-算法\">Netflix Concurrency Limits 算法</h2><p>Netflix 开源的 <code>concurrency-limits</code> 库实现了 TCP 拥塞控制思想在服务层的应用——AIMD（Additive Increase, Multiplicative Decrease）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[请求成功&lt;br/&gt;延迟正常] --&gt;|加性增加| B[limit += alpha]&#10;    C[请求超时/失败&lt;br/&gt;或延迟飙升] --&gt;|乘性减少| D[&quot;limit = limit × beta&lt;br/&gt;(beta = 0.5~0.9)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[新的并发限额]&#10;    D --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    A[请求成功&lt;br/&gt;延迟正常] --&gt;|加性增加| B[limit += alpha]\n    C[请求超时/失败&lt;br/&gt;或延迟飙升] --&gt;|乘性减少| D[\"limit = limit × beta&lt;br/&gt;(beta = 0.5~0.9)\"]\n    B --&gt; E[新的并发限额]\n    D --&gt; E</pre><p><strong>核心参数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>初始限额</strong>：起步值（如 10），系统启动后逐步探索</li>\n<li><strong>alpha</strong>：成功时的增量（如 1），越大探索越快但越不稳定</li>\n<li><strong>beta</strong>：失败时的衰减因子（如 0.75），越小降得越猛</li>\n<li><strong>最小限额</strong>：不会低于此值（如 1），防止完全停服</li>\n<li><strong>最大限额</strong>：不会高于此值（如 1000），防止无限增长</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gradient 算法</strong>（Netflix 推荐）：不使用固定的 alpha/beta，而是根据当前延迟与历史最小延迟的比值（梯度）来决定调整方向和幅度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>gradient</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{gradient} = \\frac{RTT_{min}}{RTT_{current}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gradient</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>new_limit</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>old_limit</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>gradient</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>queue_size</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{new\\_limit} = \\text{old\\_limit} \\times \\text{gradient} + \\text{queue\\_size}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">new_limit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">old_limit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gradient</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queue_size</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{current}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，gradient 接近 1，限额缓慢增长；当延迟飙升时，gradient 远小于 1，限额快速收缩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"envoy-adaptive-concurrency-filter\">Envoy Adaptive Concurrency Filter</h2><p>Envoy 代理内建了自适应并发限制功能，基于 Netflix Gradient 算法的思想：</p>\n<p><strong>工作机制</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>持续采样成功请求的延迟，维护一个滑动窗口内的延迟最小值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>计算当前请求的延迟与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的比值</li>\n<li>当比值超过阈值（如 2.0x）时，降低并发限额</li>\n<li>当连续多个请求延迟正常时，逐步增加并发限额</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>配置示例</strong>（Envoy filter）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"http_filters:&#10;  - name: envoy.filters.http.adaptive_concurrency&#10;    typed_config:&#10;      &#39;@type&#39;: type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.adaptive_concurrency.v3.AdaptiveConcurrency&#10;      gradient_controller_config:&#10;        sample_aggregate_percentile:&#10;          value: 90&#10;        concurrency_limit_params:&#10;          max_concurrency_limit: 1000&#10;          concurrency_update_interval: 0.1s&#10;        min_rtt_calc_params:&#10;          interval: 30s&#10;          request_count: 50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">http_filters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">envoy.filters.http.adaptive_concurrency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    typed_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.adaptive_concurrency.v3.AdaptiveConcurrency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      gradient_controller_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        sample_aggregate_percentile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        concurrency_limit_params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          max_concurrency_limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          concurrency_update_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.1s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        min_rtt_calc_params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          request_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键配置解读</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>sample_aggregate_percentile: 90</code>：使用 P90 延迟而非平均值——对尾部延迟更敏感</li>\n<li><code>concurrency_update_interval: 0.1s</code>：每 100ms 重新计算一次限额——快速响应</li>\n<li><code>min_rtt_calc_params.interval: 30s</code>：每 30s 重新测量基线延迟——适应后端能力变化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"令牌桶-自适应的混合方案\">令牌桶 + 自适应的混合方案</h2><p>纯粹的并发限制不能替代速率限制——它们解决的是不同的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>威胁</th>\n<th>速率限制应对</th>\n<th>并发限制应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大量快速请求（DDoS）</td>\n<td>有效</td>\n<td>部分有效（请求快速完成后释放槽位）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少量慢请求占用资源</td>\n<td>无效（速率看起来正常）</td>\n<td>有效（检测到延迟上升即收缩）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配额公平性执行</td>\n<td>核心能力</td>\n<td>不适用（无用户维度）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推荐的混合架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    REQ[请求到达] --&gt; RL{速率限制检查&lt;br/&gt;per-user 令牌桶}&#10;    RL --&gt;|超限| R1[429 Rate Limited]&#10;    RL --&gt;|通过| AC{自适应并发检查&lt;br/&gt;per-service 动态限额}&#10;    AC --&gt;|超限| R2[503 Service Unavailable]&#10;    AC --&gt;|通过| PROC[处理请求]&#10;    PROC --&gt; DONE[返回响应]&#10;    DONE --&gt;|更新延迟信号| AC\">graph TD\n    REQ[请求到达] --&gt; RL{速率限制检查&lt;br/&gt;per-user 令牌桶}\n    RL --&gt;|超限| R1[429 Rate Limited]\n    RL --&gt;|通过| AC{自适应并发检查&lt;br/&gt;per-service 动态限额}\n    AC --&gt;|超限| R2[503 Service Unavailable]\n    AC --&gt;|通过| PROC[处理请求]\n    PROC --&gt; DONE[返回响应]\n    DONE --&gt;|更新延迟信号| AC</pre><p>速率限制在前——执行商业配额合约（per-user/per-tenant），自适应并发在后——保护后端免于过载（per-service）。两者互补：速率限制保证公平性，自适应并发保证可用性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号选择与灵敏度\">信号选择与灵敏度</h2><p>自适应系统的质量取决于它监听的信号。常用信号及其特点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>噪声</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P99 延迟</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（受尾部请求影响）</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P50 延迟</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>平稳流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率（5xx）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>后端已经故障时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列深度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>有显式队列的系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 利用率</td>\n<td>低（滞后）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>长时间维度的容量规划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途请求数</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>并发度直接度量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>避免信号过度灵敏</strong>：单个慢请求（如 GC pause）不应该触发限额收缩。通过以下策略平滑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用分位数（P90/P99）而非最大值</li>\n<li>对信号做指数加权移动平均（EWMA）</li>\n<li>设置最小采样数（如至少 50 个请求后才调整限额）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与熔断器的关系\">与熔断器的关系</h2><p>自适应并发和熔断器（Circuit Breaker）都基于延迟/错误信号做出保护决策，但干预时机和力度不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自适应并发</strong>：渐进式调整——从 100% 到 0% 连续变化，始终允许一定量的请求通过</li>\n<li><strong>熔断器</strong>：二值式切换——要么全开（100% 放行），要么全断（0% 放行），中间有半开探测状态</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者配合使用：自适应并发处理&quot;后端变慢但还能工作&quot;的灰色地带，熔断器处理&quot;后端彻底崩溃&quot;的黑色地带。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自适应并发控制用实时信号替代静态配置，让限流策略跟随系统能力动态调整</li>\n<li>Netflix Gradient 算法借鉴 TCP 拥塞控制思想，根据延迟梯度调整并发限额</li>\n<li>Envoy 内建的 adaptive_concurrency filter 提供开箱即用的实现</li>\n<li>速率限制（商业配额）和自适应并发（系统保护）互补使用效果最佳</li>\n<li>信号选择需要平衡灵敏度与稳定性，避免对噪声过度反应</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>前一篇 <a href=\"gateway-rate-limiting\">网关层限流</a> 介绍静态限流策略的网关部署</li>\n<li>服务网格中的弹性模式（熔断、重试、超时）如何与自适应限流协同：<a href=\"../../service-mesh/traffic-management/resilience-patterns\">弹性模式</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自适应并发控制","id":"自适应并发控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从速率限制到并发限制的范式转换","id":"从速率限制到并发限制的范式转换"},{"level":2,"text":"Netflix Concurrency Limits 算法","id":"netflix-concurrency-limits-算法"},{"level":2,"text":"Envoy Adaptive Concurrency Filter","id":"envoy-adaptive-concurrency-filter"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌桶 + 自适应的混合方案","id":"令牌桶-自适应的混合方案"},{"level":2,"text":"信号选择与灵敏度","id":"信号选择与灵敏度"},{"level":2,"text":"与熔断器的关系","id":"与熔断器的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"网关层限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/gateway-rate-limiting"},"next":{"title":"多租户配额与分级策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/multi-tenant-quotas"}}